  "idea": "Cobalt: clean, ad-free video and audio downloader with no paywalls",
  "text": "The only media downloader tool you will ever need on your bookmarks bar. Maintaining separate downloader bookmarks for YouTube, TikTok, and Instagram clutters your workspace and invites malware. Unofficial converter sites break whenever platforms update their code, stalling your production schedule during tight editing deadlines. Cobalt provides an open-source universal engine that processes links across major platforms with zero ads. You extract clean video and audio in one click.",
